## Runtime data: uploaded sounds and the SQLite database live on a volume,
## not in the repository.
## Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare "data/" also matches
## src/SemperSounds.Core/Data/ (git is case-insensitive on Windows), which silently
## kept the whole EF layer — entities, DbContext and every migration — out of the repo.
/data/
## Development default from appsettings.Development.json ("./data" beside the Web project).
/src/SemperSounds.Web/data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

